#: scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 529c09282f60bc4fe2763493796db3edb09a371f3c3888f15f6a715a10f3bca0
